  "summary": "I'm a full stack web developer with over two decades of experience, but I didn't start in tech — I started in sales and marketing. That path turned out to be a feature, not a bug. Understanding how businesses actually work has made me a better developer and a more useful partner to the teams and clients I work with.\n\nI build and maintain web applications end-to-end: front-end interfaces, back-end logic, APIs, database design, the works. I've worked in e-commerce, healthcare, publishing, real estate, and enterprise environments — mostly places where the systems I touched had real stakes attached to them.\n\nI care about writing clean, practical code, asking good questions before writing any code at all, and showing up as someone my team can genuinely rely on. If you're looking for a developer who can also think like a business person, let's connect.\n\n\nSkills: ColdFusion, HTML, CSS, Responsive Design, Mobile Design, Wordpress, MSSQL, MySQL, JQuery, Project Management, Business Analysis, Apache & MS Web Servers, Stored Procedures, Object Oriented Programming, Coldbox, MVC Frameworks",
